ANCHORUM — Unified 4-Stage Evidence Intelligence Pipeline

positional arguments:
  {ingest-proton,ingest-dir,demo,verify,verify-chain,status}
    ingest-proton       Ingest from ProtonMail IMAP
    ingest-dir          Ingest .eml files from directory
    demo                Run 3-email demo through all 4 stages
    verify              Full chain/replay/projection verification
    verify-chain        Stage 1 hash chain integrity check
    status              Show ANCHORUM component availability

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --config CONFIG       Path to JSON config file (anchorum or stage1 format)
  --dossier DOSSIER     Override dossier ID
  --output-dir OUTPUT_DIR
                        Override output directory
  --no-stage2           Skip Stage 2 (dossier registry)
  --no-stage3           Skip Stage 3 (Red DART)
  --no-stage4           Skip Stage 4 (osint-platform)
